  "title": "V3 stage-oriented refactor CP11d — Historical Integrity relocation",
  "goal": "Make the Post-stage historical-integrity gate directory the sole active owner of the IFX Historical Integrity engine and manifest.",
  "acceptanceCriteria": [
    "The Historical Integrity engine and manifest exist only under stages/post/gates/historical-integrity; the manifest bytes are preserved and the engine changes only its location-derived repository-root default.",
    "The public dispatcher, maintenance command, command catalog, Post trust contract, policy registry and trusted-component manifest name only the stage-owned location.",
    "The temporary migration registry entry is removed and the exact final manifest is registered for history-manifest candidate validation.",
    "Generated documentation is deterministic and contains no active legacy history path.",
    "Historical Integrity, package, target-root separation and trusted-base parity tests retain their fixed-corpus verdicts.",
    "The move, trusted-base and policy/config authorizations are each consumed exactly once."
